{
  "name": "18 · PDF Invoice Parser",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 18 · PDF Invoice Parser\nTurn a PDF invoice into structured data, with **no AI and no API key**.\n\n1. **Download Invoice** fetches the PDF (a binary file)\n2. **Extract PDF Text** reads its text\n3. **Parse Invoice** uses regular expressions to pull out the number, dates, totals and line items\n4. **Check Totals** verifies that line items add up to the subtotal and subtotal + VAT = total\n\nRegex works great when invoices come from **one known supplier/template**. For many different layouts, swap *Parse Invoice* for an AI *Information Extractor* (see recipe 09).",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-80, -460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/YalinMa/n8n-cookbook/main/examples/18-pdf-invoice-parser/sample-invoice.pdf",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Download Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [220, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Extract PDF Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [440, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pull structured fields out of the invoice text with regular expressions.\nconst text = $input.first().json.text;\n\nconst find = (regex) => (text.match(regex) ?? [])[1]?.trim() ?? null;\nconst money = (regex) => { const v = find(regex); return v === null ? null : Number(v.replace(',', '')); };\n\n// Line items look like: \"Espresso beans 1kg | 10 | 24.50 | 245.00\"\nconst lineItems = [...text.matchAll(/^(.+?)\\s*\\|\\s*(\\d+)\\s*\\|\\s*([\\d.,]+)\\s*\\|\\s*([\\d.,]+)\\s*$/gm)]\n  .filter((m) => !/description/i.test(m[1]))\n  .map((m) => ({\n    description: m[1].trim(),\n    quantity: Number(m[2]),\n    unitPrice: Number(m[3]),\n    amount: Number(m[4]),\n  }));\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    supplier: text.split('\\n').map((l) => l.trim()).find(Boolean),\n    invoiceNumber: find(/Invoice Number:\\s*(\\S+)/i),\n    invoiceDate: find(/Invoice Date:\\s*([\\d-]+)/i),\n    dueDate: find(/Due Date:\\s*([\\d-]+)/i),\n    billTo: find(/Bill To:\\s*(.+)/i),\n    currency: find(/Total Due:\\s*[\\d.,]+\\s*([A-Z]{3})/i),\n    subtotal: money(/Subtotal:\\s*([\\d.,]+)/i),\n    vat: money(/VAT[^:]*:\\s*([\\d.,]+)/i),\n    total: money(/Total Due:\\s*([\\d.,]+)/i),\n    lineItems,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Parse Invoice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "name": "lineItemsMatchSubtotal",
              "value": "={{ Math.abs($json.lineItems.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.amount, 0) - $json.subtotal) < 0.01 }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
              "name": "totalIsCorrect",
              "value": "={{ Math.abs($json.subtotal + $json.vat - $json.total) < 0.01 }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000103",
              "name": "daysUntilDue",
              "value": "={{ Math.ceil(DateTime.fromISO($json.dueDate).diff($now.startOf('day'), 'days').days) }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Check Totals",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.lineItemsMatchSubtotal && $json.totalIsCorrect && $json.invoiceNumber !== null }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
